{
  "id": "ai4sgSearchAgt01",
  "name": "AI4SG · 2 Search Agent (Skill: search)",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 · Search Agent (runs the Search Skill)\nHandles one task at a time, e.g. **Indonesia × id × news**. The agent's system prompt = **the full Search Skill** (the experts' search methodology) + this task.\nThe agent decides which language, keywords, sites and pages to use, instead of calling fixed APIs.\nTools: multilingual web/news search (SearXNG, by language and region), scholarly search (OpenAlex), open-source projects (GitHub), read full web page or PDF (sub-workflow 0), Think (plan before searching).\nOutput: a structured candidate list; each item must state source type, country, language and why it was selected.",
        "width": 1480,
        "height": 144,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "256f57f7-49c9-5006-9156-b28939f66754",
      "name": "Note · overview",
